{"assessments": [], "narrative": "Iteration 17, appraise stage. No assessments are due and no new discovery evidence has been delivered. The investigation reached its definitive endpoint after 59 claims across 16 iterations.

**State confirmation.** Four claims are accepted, validated, and closed (H13 NLR≥3, H16 CRP≥10, H33 Stage IV, H37 ECOG PS≥2; all ~0.45 log-months, ~18% relative PFS, validated at α=0.0038 with Δ≤0.003). Fifty-five claims are rejected and closed. Four claims (H11, H25, H26, H30) remain unresolved/deferred because continuous research signatures A, B, and C cannot be tested with the mean_difference framework—this is an irreducible methodological limitation, not a data gap.

**No action required.** No new proposals, analyses, or validation requests are scientifically justified. The 7 remaining validation requests have no eligible target: all four accepted claims are already validated with near-identical estimates, and no other claim approaches the 10% clinical significance threshold (0.251 log-months). The next-largest effect after the four accepted findings is H12 (research_marker_d, 0.151 log-months, ~6% relative), which is 1.7× below the threshold and already rejected. The investigation is definitively complete.", "validate": null}
